{"ocrText": "383\nHOW  TO  GUARANTEE  SUCCESS  OF  CONSTITUENT  ASSEMBLY\nThat would truly be a \u201crevolutionary-democratic\u201d prepa-\nration for the elections to the Constituent Assembly; it\nwould be aid to the countryside on the part of the advanced\nworkers and soldiers. It would be state aid to the people\u2019s\nenlightenment, and not to their stultification and deception;\nit would be real freedom of the press for all, and not for the\nrich. It would be a break with that accursed, slavish past\nwhich compels us to suffer the usurpation by the rich of the\ngreat  cause  of  informing  and  teaching  the  peasants.\nRabochy  Put  No.  11,\nPublished  according  to\nSeptember  28  (15),  1917\nthe  text  in  Rabochy  Put\nSigned:  N.  Lenin", "textLayer": [{"text": "383", "x": 85.3, "y": 6.06, "w": 3.57, "h": 1.56, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "HOW  TO  GUARANTEE  SUCCESS  OF  CONSTITUENT  ASSEMBLY", "x": 16.41, "y": 6.11, "w": 64.98, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "That would truly be a \u201c", "x": 11.67, "y": 9.53, "w": 32.45, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "revolutionary-democratic", "x": 44.27, "y": 9.55, "w": 33.55, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "\u201d prepa-", "x": 77.96, "y": 9.53, "w": 10.94, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "ration for the elections to the Constituent Assembly; it", "x": 8.89, "y": 11.47, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "would be aid to the countryside on the part of the advanced", "x": 8.89, "y": 13.39, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "workers and soldiers. It would be state aid to the people\u2019s", "x": 8.89, "y": 15.33, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "enlightenment, and not to their stultification and deception;", "x": 8.89, "y": 17.27, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "it would be real freedom of the press", "x": 8.89, "y": 19.2, "w": 49.53, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "for all", "x": 58.84, "y": 19.22, "w": 8.15, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": ", and not for the", "x": 67.02, "y": 19.2, "w": 21.85, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "rich. It would be a break with that accursed, slavish past", "x": 8.89, "y": 21.14, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "which compels us to suffer the usurpation by the rich of the", "x": 8.89, "y": 23.08, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "great  cause  of  informing  and  teaching  the  peasants.", "x": 8.89, "y": 25.0, "w": 70.84, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Rabochy", "x": 10.52, "y": 28.91, "w": 8.29, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Put", "x": 19.7, "y": 28.91, "w": 3.41, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "No.", "x": 24.0, "y": 28.9, "w": 3.23, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "11", "x": 28.15, "y": 28.95, "w": 1.69, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": ",", "x": 30.07, "y": 28.9, "w": 0.53, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Published", "x": 65.45, "y": 28.9, "w": 9.43, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "according", "x": 75.79, "y": 28.9, "w": 9.36, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "to", "x": 86.04, "y": 28.9, "w": 1.82, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "September", "x": 8.89, "y": 30.25, "w": 10.27, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "28", "x": 20.09, "y": 30.3, "w": 2.12, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "(", "x": 23.23, "y": 30.25, "w": 0.67, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "15", "x": 24.03, "y": 30.3, "w": 1.9, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "),", "x": 26.16, "y": 30.25, "w": 1.33, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "1917", "x": 28.39, "y": 30.3, "w": 3.95, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "the", "x": 64.77, "y": 30.25, "w": 2.97, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "text", "x": 68.65, "y": 30.25, "w": 3.67, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "in", "x": 73.21, "y": 30.25, "w": 1.84, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Rabochy", "x": 75.97, "y": 30.26, "w": 8.29, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Put",